OL,3,GNEWSA'All anger has been taken away' -
OL,4,Asays daughter of solicitor murdered by
OL,5,AIRA, as report published
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe murder, which happened in
OL,8,FCoalisland, County Tyrone, was examined
OL,9,Fby the Independent Commission for
OL,10,FReconciliation and Information Recovery
OL,11,F(ICRIR).
OL,13,FThe investigation into his death was
OL,14,Frequested by O'Kelly's now deceased
OL,15,Fson, Roger, who met ICRIR staff last
OL,16,Fyear alongside his sister Anne Frances
OL,17,FO'Kelly and Roger's wife.
